```
ROLE: product_realist  VOTE: green
REAL_USE_CASE: Multilingual LLM training-data pipelines (C4, mC4, OSCAR) run by data-platform teams at Meta, Google, HF, AllenAI; privacy/compliance audits for memorization risk; eval-contamination checks. Needed when deduping web-scale corpora where CJK fullwidth and European compatibility variants are common — ja 90.3% and zh 82.9% of C4 docs have a distinct NFKC-twin (packet L1 prevalence), fr 21.4%, ar 16.9%, de 14.7%.
OPERATIONAL_SIGNIFICANCE: Real win, not microbench. L1 on REAL C4-multilingual (20,000 docs, 5 langs) finds 9,044 model-identical (NFKC+casefold) pairs; 8,605 (95.1%) escape production datatrove dedup (NFD+lower). Per-lang residual_FN_rate: ja 98.4%, zh 99.8%, de 94.7%, fr 94.6%, ar 55.6% — each ≥55× the 1% gate. Prevalence 45.2% of docs have a twin. Robustness: 34.6% of residual FNs survive char-5-gram MinHash at T=0.8 (58.7% word-token), so not an exact-string artifact. Driver counts from packet: 300,261 fullwidth ASCII chars (CJK web), 23,850 other_compat (ß→ss, ligatures, etc.), 14,148 halfwidth kana — all collapsed by NFKC+casefold but left distinct by NFD+lower because NFD is canonical-only by Unicode spec and lower() ≠ casefold().
ADOPTION_BARRIER: [Trivial code change — replace NFD+lower with NFKC+casefold in deduper; Awareness gap — committee#1 verified no production tool currently does it (≥2 codebases); Must align deduper config to the specific model's normalization (packet notes NFKC+casefold is the pervasive multilingual default; pure-NFC tokenizer would shrink gap); One-time reprocessing cost for existing corpora; CPU delta for NFKC vs NFD negligible vs shingling/MinHash; No blocker for locale-sensitive case if using the model's own normalizer]
RATIONALE: Packet L1 (EXP-0069) residual_FN_rate=0.9514 (8,605/9,044) meets committee#1 GREEN gate (≥1%) by 95×. L0 (EXP-0068) proves mechanism: FN=1.00 when deduper normalizer weaker than model, 0.00 when aligned; matched-edit-distance typo control passes. Committee#1 (VERDICT-0057) verified seam genuinely open in ≥2 codebases and found no prior-art collision; IIR §2.2 names the mechanism class but L1 quantifies magnitude on real data. The 95% hidden exposure is current (no production tool implements the fix), making it actionable safety/privacy/eval-contamination guidance: align deduper normalization to the model's NFKC+casefold.
```
